Package: reaper-installer
Version: 0.0.0
Section: contrib/sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: curl, tar, xz-utils, desktop-file-utils, xdg-utils
Maintainer: Huayuluoshi <2318494274@qq.com>
Description: REAPER installer wrapper (downloads and runs official Linux installer)
 This package does not contain REAPER itself. During configuration (postinst),
 it downloads the official REAPER Linux tarball matching the host architecture
 from reaper.fm, extracts it, and executes the official install-reaper.sh script
 so the user can interact with the installer directly.
 .
 Removing this package attempts to run the official uninstall logic and
 clean up REAPER files installed under the chosen prefix.
